<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Corporate Rates</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div class="center">
    <h1>Casa del Rio</h1>
    <h2>M E L A K A</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <p>Confidential Corporate Rates</p>
    <p>Casa del Rio Melaka – Universitas Pelita Harapan</p>
    <p>Page 2 of 5</p>
    <p>1st January 2020 to 31st December 2020</p>
  </div>

  <h3>PREFERRED CORPORATE RATES</h3>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th></th>
        <th>Season</th>
        <th>Low</th>
        <th>Shoulder</th>
        <th>Peak</th>
        <th></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>From:</td>
        <td><span data-field="season_from">{{ season_from }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_low">{{ season_low }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_shoulder">{{ season_shoulder }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_peak">{{ season_peak }}</span></td>
        <td>Breakfast</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>To:</td>
        <td><span data-field="season_to">{{ season_to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_low_to">{{ season_low_to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_shoulder_to">{{ season_shoulder_to }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="season_peak_to">{{ season_peak_to }}</span></td>
        <td>01 Person</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Deluxe Lago</td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_lago">{{ rate_deluxe_lago }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_lago_low">{{ rate_deluxe_lago_low }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_lago_shoulder">{{ rate_deluxe_lago_shoulder }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_lago_peak">{{ rate_deluxe_lago_peak }}</span></td>
        <td>01 Person</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Deluxe River</td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_river">{{ rate_deluxe_river }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_river_low">{{ rate_deluxe_river_low }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_river_shoulder">{{ rate_deluxe_river_shoulder }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="rate_deluxe_river_peak">{{ rate_deluxe_river_peak }}</span></td>
        <td>01 Person</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p><strong>NOTES:-</strong></p>
  <ul>
    <li>All rates quoted are in Ringgit Malaysia and are inclusive of 6% Service Tax and non-commissionable.</li>
    <li>The rate above is inclusive of accommodation & 01 Breakfast.</li>
    <li>Add on Breakfast at <span data-field="breakfast_add_on_rate">{{ breakfast_add_on_rate }}</span> per person per day.</li>
    <li>Rates may be increased without notice due to changes in, or imposition of government taxes or levies.</li>
    <li>Corporate rates may not be applicable for group bookings of 10 rooms and above.</li>
    <li>This offer is made on the condition that reservations are placed by your organization with Hotel directly. Please quote your company name when making reservations to enjoy these rates.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="center">
    <h1>Casa del Rio</h1>
    <h2>M E L A K A</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="center" style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <p>Confidential Corporate Rates</p>
    <p>Casa del Rio Melaka – Universitas Pelita Harapan</p>
    <p>Page 3 of 5</p>
    <p>1st January 2020 to 31st December 2020</p>
  </div>

  <h3>ADD ON BENEFITS (CORPORATE COURTESY):</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Complimentary in-room Mini Bar per room per stay, non – accumulative.</li>
    <li>Free Flow of Corporate Drinks (House Wine, House Beer, Soft Drinks & Juices only) from 6.00pm – 8.00pm at River Café.</li>
    <li>Complimentary 02 pieces of regular laundry service per day, non – accumulative. Applicable for minimum of 02 nights stay & above terms and conditions apply.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Guest Room Features includes:-</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="room_feature_1">{{ room_feature_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="room_feature_2">{{ room_feature_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="room_feature_3">{{ room_feature_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="room_feature_4">{{ room_feature_4 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="room_feature_5">{{ room_feature_5 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <h3>TAXES</h3>
  <p><strong>1) Heritage Tax</strong></p>
  <p>On 01 April 2012, the <span data-field="tax_authority">{{ tax_authority }}</span> Government imposed a mandatory <span data-field="heritage_tax_rate">{{ heritage_tax_rate }}</span> Heritage Tax per occupied room per night for all hotel accommodation. This fee may change without prior notice.</p>

  <p><strong>Effective 01 January 2015, Casa del Rio Melaka Hotel will begin collecting this fee directly from all your guests upon their check-out. Please help to inform all your guests about this compulsory amount to be paid directly to Hotel.</strong></p>

  <h3>PEAK SEASONS DATES – 2020</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Occasion</th>
        <th>Super Peak Rate</th>
        <th>Weekend Rate Apply</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in peak_seasons %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ item.occasion }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.super_peak_rate }}</td>
        <td>{{ item.weekend_rate }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

