  <h3>TERMS AND CONDITIONS: -</h3>

  <h4>CHECK IN / CHECK OUT</h4>
  <p>Check in: After 1500 hours / Check out time is at 1200 hours. Early check-in and Late check-out rooms will be subject to availability.</p>
  <p>Corporate rates will be accorded to guests with advance reservations only. To ensure that your valued guests enjoy the above corporate rates, kindly place your reservations at least 24 hours in advance, either by calling our Reservations Department or by fax.</p>

  <h4>CONFIDENTIAL</h4>
  <p>All information contained in this agreement is private and confidential and may not be disclosed to third parties or other companies for whatever reason or purpose.</p>

  <h4>GUARANTEE OF ROOM RESERVATION/S</h4>
  <p>To facilitate smooth guest registration at check-in, all room reservations must be guaranteed. Please note that reservations without a guarantee will only be held to 16:00 hours on the day of expected arrival. Reservations may be guaranteed by any of the following methods:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Credit card guarantee: Please provide cardholder's (guest's) name, card number and expiry date.</li>
    <li>Credit application should be submitted to the hotel at least seven (7) working days prior to arrival, and is subject to the hotel's credit approval. Once approved, all accounts must be settled within 14 days. The Hotel reserves the right to refuse any new bookings on a credit basis until all outstanding accounts are settled.</li>
    <li>Issuance of 'Letter of Undertaking' on Company's letterhead will be accepted subject to the Hotel's policies.</li>
    <li>Company paying account will require an approved credit facilities from the hotel's management abiding to term & condition stipulated within. Only company with approved credit facility are allowed to sign to company following prior authorized letter of undertaking forms its respective company.</li>
    <li>In cases where payments are to be made by way of Telegraph Transfer, the bank details are as follows: -</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Pay to:</strong> CASA DEL RIO (M) SDN BHD</p>
  <p><strong>Bank:</strong> CIMB BANK BERHAD</p>
  <p><strong>Account:</strong> 800-4754-213</p>
  <p><strong>Branch:</strong> KOTA LAKSAMAANA BRANCH</p>
  <p><strong>Address:</strong> NO. 69 & 71 GF & 1F, JALAN KL3/8, SEKSYEN 3, TAMAN KOTA LAKSAMAANA, 75200 MELAKA, MALAYSIA</p>
  <p><strong>Swift Code:</strong> CIBBMYKL</p>
